---
middleware "auth"
---

{* Session guard for the account pages.

   Middleware is a COMPILE OPTION, not a path convention: the host that mounts
   this file passes `is_middleware: true`, and only then are `{redirect}` and
   `request.*` legal. Inside middleware the opposite rule applies - `request`,
   `env` and `loop` are the only path roots you may read, so there is no store,
   no cart and no product here. *}
{if !request.cookies.session}
  {redirect "/login"}
{/if}

{* Expiry is deliberately NOT checked here. The language has no clock and no
   callable functions, so `Date.now()` parses and evaluates to null, and a
   comparison against null compares Equal - the branch would never fire while
   looking like it worked. Expire the cookie wherever it is minted and let the
   check above treat an expired session as a missing one. *}
